<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύμᾰτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, 
			Ep.
		
		Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσχατος</span>
			, <i>hindmost, last</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.254
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πυμάτοισι</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ πρώτοισι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				11.65
			</span></i>; also, <i>outmost</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντυξ ἣ π. θέεν ἀσπίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.608
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥινὸς ὕπερ π</span>. above
				<i>the root of</i> the nose, <i><span class="en">
				13.616
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυμάτῃ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὕδρῃ</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> δ᾽ ἐπίκειται εἴδωλον κόρακος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					448
				</span></i>
			; <i>nethermost</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					12.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ταρτάρου βάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Trag.</u>
					295
				</span></i>
			; <i>remotest</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωλειοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.451
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time,
				<i>last</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρα κτείνας
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.759
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οὖτιν ἐγὼ πύματον ἔδομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.369
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργειφόντῃ πυμάτῳ σπένδεσκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.138
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τέλεον δρόμον . . ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.373
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δ᾽ ὁπλίσσατο δόρπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.20
				</span></i>
			; Trag. only in lyr., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1236
				</span></i>
			: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύματον</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύματα</span> as Adv., <i>at the
				last, for the last time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύματόν τε καὶ ὕστατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.203
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕστατα καὶ πύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.685
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				20.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πυμάτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1675
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of
			Degree, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τι πύματον ὀλοίμαν</span> by
			whatever is <i>the last, worst</i> fate, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OT</u>
				661
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
